OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie water supply issues
OL,4,Aresolved after three days of disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FWater supply issues at Scotland's
OL,7,Flargest prison, which left some inmates
OL,8,Funable to run taps or flush toilets for
OL,9,Fnearly three days, have been resolved.
OL,11,FSome prisoners at two halls in
OL,12,FBarlinnie in Glasgow first experienced
OL,13,Fproblems on Thursday night and had no
OL,14,Faccess to bottled water.
OL,16,FOn Friday the Scottish Prison Service
OL,17,F(SPS) said the issue would extend into
OL,18,Fthe weekend, and visitors to the jail
OL,19,Fon Saturday told BBC Scotland News that
OL,20,Fthe laundry was mounting up.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
